{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With your courage, restore the glory of the Moonlight Sect.</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Tuuk, one of the Six Knights of the [Moonup Sect], you awaken from a 100-year slumber only to find that the Moon Cavern has been taken over by the [Moondown Sect].  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the critically endangered [Moonup Sect], you must face death fearlessly and embark on a perilous journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will collect treasures scattered across the land, rally like-minded allies,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and wield the [Mantis Blade] to battle formidable foes in the sunless world of the Moon Cavern, using combat skills to cut them down one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aUndying Hare\u300b is a pixel-style 2D action-adventure game where combat and exploration are at the heart of the experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/79c5604471d8f4ffd3bf07bc54ad6b73.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Moon Cave World is composed of several different regions that are connected, and each region has its own unique style and products.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/c4464e1722c40a0f0df5572449c02b50.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies will be formidable. Mastering their moves and finding the perfect moments to parry is the key to victory. Hone your skills, deftly utilize dodges and blocks, and crush all who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/d6e10edb2776326780c23ac4cef5eecd.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessorize with a waist token to define your style. Master your tools to streamline your combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic side-scrolling game levels with exquisite pixel art.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your dodges and blocks to engage in intense close combat with enemies using the [Mantis Blade].</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the map to find scattered treasures in the Moon Cave.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously learn new skills to enhance your basic abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 30 unique Badges to collect and mix, you can forge a warrior truly your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 props await your use!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of the Moon Cave!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is made by \u5996\u5996\u9152\u5927\u4eba(yoyojo sama) alone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877190?t=1759200342","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/be37af67d335196452efaca44a474d6d93cace2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759200342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/b3755a763f50815736c2cd21c4ae0b37a8bd9201/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759200342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/b3755a763f50815736c2cd21c4ae0b37a8bd9201/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759200342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With your courage, restore the glory of the Moonlight Sect.</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Tuuk, one of the Six Knights of the [Moonup Sect], you awaken from a 100-year slumber only to find that the Moon Cavern has been taken over by the [Moondown Sect].  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the critically endangered [Moonup Sect], you must face death fearlessly and embark on a perilous journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will collect treasures scattered across the land, rally like-minded allies,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and wield the [Mantis Blade] to battle formidable foes in the sunless world of the Moon Cavern, using combat skills to cut them down one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aUndying Hare\u300b is a pixel-style 2D action-adventure game where combat and exploration are at the heart of the experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/79c5604471d8f4ffd3bf07bc54ad6b73.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Moon Cave World is composed of several different regions that are connected, and each region has its own unique style and products.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/c4464e1722c40a0f0df5572449c02b50.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies will be formidable. Mastering their moves and finding the perfect moments to parry is the key to victory. Hone your skills, deftly utilize dodges and blocks, and crush all who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877190/extras/d6e10edb2776326780c23ac4cef5eecd.avif?t=1759200342\" width=1560 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessorize with a waist token to define your style. Master your tools to streamline your combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic side-scrolling game levels with exquisite pixel art.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your dodges and blocks to engage in intense close combat with enemies using the [Mantis Blade].</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the map to find scattered treasures in the Moon Cave.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously learn new skills to enhance your basic abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 30 unique Badges to collect and mix, you can forge a warrior truly your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 props await your use!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of the Moon Cave!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is made by \u5996\u5996\u9152\u5927\u4eba(yoyojo sama) alone.</p>","developers":["\u5996\u5996\u9152"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/